  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">PNG One United Nations Fund</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The OneUN Fund is a Trust Fund mechanism and serves as the primary funding mechanism for the PNG bilateral program&#x2019;s support to UN Agencies in PNG. The mechanism allows flexibility to add funds throughout the five-year life of the investment in support of emerging joint priorities of Australia and the UN&#x2019;s development assistance to PNG. The fund will be multi-sectoral; all bilateral sector programs will have the option to contribute from their Program Funds</narrative>
  </description>
